<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Public Service/Colorado.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Public Service/Colorado.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its rating on Public Service Co of Colorado to near-term accumulate from neutral and to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
